      "statement": "`Database` requires caller-supplied PostgreSQL user and password, defaults host to `127.0.0.1`, port to `5432`, and database to `stocksdb2`, and connects immediately; the wrapper has no environment-variable lookup, so these are code defaults rather than evidence of a configured database.",
